.TH xml_content 3
.SH NAME
xml_content \- get the text content of an XML node
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "xml.h"
.PP
.BI "const char *xml_content(xmlnode *" node ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xml_content
searches the immediate children of the given
.I node
for an
.B XML_TEXT
type node and returns a pointer to its content. Returns NULL if no text
child is found.